借力 / The Weight We Share
Original script, geometry, procedural materials, animation, camera, music and synthesized Foley created for the user.
Tools actually used: Blender 4.3.2 (Cycles CPU), Python, NumPy, SciPy, Pillow, FontTools, FFmpeg. No paid API or external generated footage.
Knowledge references are linked in FACTS.md. No figures, photographs, films, models or recordings from those sources are redistributed.
Design grammar consulted: Lemo-Opuscar white-model and teardown style notes; only general physical-material and contact-shadow relations were considered. This is a distinct original stone-arch staging, not a reproduction of those examples.
